{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫小花游嘉欣（游游）近期除被指突然富貴外，樣貌亦全面升級。</p><p>她在社交網分享一輯生活照，身穿純白色貼身上衣，搭配黑白印花超短裙，坐低歎飲品時，短裙長度剛剛好，不走光之餘又可凸顯其修長美腿，整個人靚到發光，身邊還有一個名牌包包作道具。</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:42.849168+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T03:01:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"c8e3e53d1deb8d726d88117f860b8790871ddbe54d8907a836666a94e56a33fa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}